      "Prompt wording was tuned on these same photos in four passes, so there is no held-out set. Plain wording: kind 22 of 29. A legend of the kind words: kind 25 of 29. Plus the colour, pattern and fit words: main colour exact 22 to 25 of 29. Plus the style words: no change. A wording that told the model it could answer not_clothing made it do so for 23 of 29 clothes; the final wording names that word only with its meaning.",
